# Consistent line endings: the plugin is developed on Windows and consumed on
# Linux/macOS (DSH home dirs). Text files stay LF in the worktree so the
# JSONL appenders and the CRLF-vs-LF split are never an issue.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary artifacts (if any ever land here) must not be "normalized".
*.png binary
*.ico binary
